! Nominal paradigm form productions — STEM + ENDING decomposition.
! Each paradigm has a stem lexicon (sg/pl stems) and ending lexicons.
! Surface form = stem + ending.

! ============================================================
! PRONOUNS — irregular, full forms stored
! ============================================================

